#encoding UTF-8
<div class="entry-content about-outer" itemprop="text">
    <br>
    <h2>Welcome to your new About page!</h2>
    <p>Thank you for installing the <a href="https://poblabs.github.io/weewx-belchertown/" target="_blank">Belchertown weewx skin</a>!</p>
    <p>This is the default About page. To write your own, copy <code>about.inc.example</code> to <code>about.inc</code> in the Belchertown skin folder and edit it. Plain text, HTML and weewx tags all work, and upgrades never overwrite it. <a href="https://poblabs.github.io/weewx-belchertown/customize/#about-and-records-pages" target="_blank">How to write your About page</a>, with an example to copy.</p>
    <p>weewx tags show live facts about your station. For example:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Station hardware: $station.hardware</li>
        <li>Server uptime: $station.os_uptime.long_form</li>
        <li>weewx uptime: $station.uptime.long_form</li>
        <li>weewx version: $station.version</li>
        <li>Belchertown skin version: $belchertown_version</li>
        <li>Charts drawn by: #if $chart_library == "echarts"#<a href="https://echarts.apache.org/" target="_blank">Apache ECharts</a>#else#<a href="https://www.highcharts.com/" target="_blank">Highcharts</a>#end if#</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For an example of a finished About page, see <a href="https://belchertownweather.com/about" target="_blank">belchertownweather.com/about</a>.</p>
    <p>Enjoy your new weewx skin!</p>
</div>
